  </div>

  <div class="st-split st-wide">
    <div class="st-split__text rv">
      <div class="st-decision">
        <p class="st-k">Decision B</p>
        <h3 class="st-bh">Every category one click away</h3>
        <p class="cs__p">
          Categories in the header opens a menu listing every category with a short line about
          each. The Categories page goes further, giving each one a photo, a description and a
          Discover Category button.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="cs__fig rv">
      <img
        src="{{ '/assets/images/projects/akij-bakers-menu.webp' | rel }}"
        width="1400"
