      <div class="st-decision">
        <p class="st-k">Decision C</p>
        <h3 class="st-bh">Bangla as a first-class language</h3>
        <p class="cs__p">
          Many visitors read Bangla first. A language toggle sits in the header on every page, and
          the layouts leave room for Bangla headings and copy, which run longer and taller than the
          English.
        </p>
