        <p class="st-k">Decision D</p>
        <h3 class="st-bh">Put the product facts beside the pack</h3>
        <p class="cs__p">
          The product page leads with a large photo and a gallery of pack shots. Beside it sit the
          product name, each pack size with its barcode, and a short description. Related products
