    My first round used saturated colour and illustrated banners. The client’s feedback asked for
    less visual flashiness, better balance and a more premium feel, so I kept the structure and
    rebuilt the visual language. Compare the same homepage section in each round.
  </p>
  <div class="st-wide st-tabset--steady rv">
