          alt="First-round homepage section We Make Things Happen: a bold red rounded heading above a grid of brightly coloured illustrated product banners for Bakerman's Biscuit, Fast Breads, Funtastic Cookies, Hi5 Chocolate and Yum Cakes, and a red View All Products button."
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
