<section class="cs__sec" aria-labelledby="s10">
  <p class="st-k rv">10 · Reflection</p>
  <h2 class="cs__h rv" id="s10">Premium comes from restraint</h2>
  <p class="cs__p rv">
    The first round tried to make every brand loud at once. The revision showed that a quieter base
    lets the food and each category’s colour stand out, and makes a large range easier to browse.
  </p>
  <div class="st-grid st-g2 st-wide">
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Learning</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">Feedback is design input</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">
        Turning broad comments like “less flashy” into specific changes to colour, type, imagery and
        spacing kept the revision focused.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Growth</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">Designing a system, not pages</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">
        One template with a colour and pattern per category, carried across two languages, three
        breakpoints and the admin panel behind it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
